==Description==
'''v1.62.0''' is the one hundred and thirteenth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 23rd of April 2025. It added the {{Color|EventMission|Ducky}} [[DJ Booth]] skin.

This version contained three updates, the main v1.62.0 (released 23 April 2025) and two minor updates, v1.62.1 (released 23 April 2025) and v1.62.1a (released 25 April 2025).

==Additions==
*{{Color|EventMission|Ducky}} [[DJ Booth]]

==Removals==
*[[PVP Test]]
*[[Crash Course]]
*[[Judging Hall]]
*[[Laser Stadium]]
*[[Warm Land]]
*[[Airhorn]]
*[[Energy Drink]]
*[[Protein Shake]]
*[[Molten Hazmat]]

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*[[DuckyBath Nametag]] is now obtainable through '''The Duck went down to Georgia''' [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]].
*Reduced {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Duck}} [[Giant Skeleton (Unit)|Giant Skeleton]] size.
*Increased {{Color|DuckyRevenge|Duck}} [[Executioner Skeleton]] size.
*Fixed [[Ducky Revenge Event]] charms having collisions, allowing them to fling players downwards or upwards and making them shake uncontrollably around the placement area.

:In '''v1.62.1''':
*Fixed [[Swarmer]] being impossible to place down and it using its updated model.

:In '''v1.62.1a''':
*Fixed 1POINT7MIL and EnterCodeHere [[Codes]] being usable again.

